        "Title": "The Organizers",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ANCESTRAL_SMOOTHSNAKE",
        "PublicId": "133435177397",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bbd196c0-3354-441c-aa64-9180ac335d9f).Image",
        "Description": "Summer is coming and it&apos;s finally nice weather in dartmor england. the owners of a large villa are organizing a garden show, a perfect opportunity. Eliminate the 2 providence members Sebastian Sato and Gulshan Yazdani. Also eliminate mr. yazdani&apos;s son-in-law theo willis, he overheard yazdani telling important information about the providence on the phone. He is currently doing an internship as a waiter. The client doesn&apos;t want any trouble so just eliminate your targets. Good luck 47",
        "GameVersion": "8.17.0.0",
        "IsPublished": true,
        "Entitlements": [
            "LOCATION_ANCESTRAL"
